WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
Hey Doc, what's H. Pylori?

00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,200
And how do I get rid of it?

00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,600
How did it start?

00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,640
Well, he'll go back to Pylori is a bacterial infection.

00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,880
It's actually the most common bacterial infection

00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,000
in the world.

00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
And it is normally a part of our microbiota in a balance.

00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,840
When he gets out of balance and it starts growing,

00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,360
many times it initiates in the stomach.

00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,840
And most commonly, it's from a deficiency

00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,520
in the production of hydrochloric acid.

00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:30,680
So when we start with adding hydrochloric acid

00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:33,560
to our diet with each meal, that could be very helpful.

00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,640
Maybe it needs to start with apple cider vinegar.

00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,280
I have a whole portal call on our website

00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,600
that you can look at.

00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,200
But H. Pylori can creep into the stomach

00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:45,280
and grow unabated and cause ulcers in the stomach,

00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,480
the esophagus, and the intestinal tract.

00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,520
It can also go beyond the stomach.

00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,960
It into the blood vessels.

00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,960
It is one of the top causes of cardiovascular disease,

00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:57,440
which is still the top rated cause of death

00:00:57,440 --> 00:00:58,560
in the United States.

00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,880
So it's something that we need to deal with.

00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:03,280
H. Pylori can cause skin issues.

00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,880
H. Pylori is a number one cause of stomach cancer

00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:08,640
and it can be cause of other cancers as well.

00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,520
So it's something that we need to deal with

00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,680
because it causes gut issues and systemic issues.

00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:16,520
Look on our website for more on H. Pylori.

